WEBVTT

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.122
and my dad told me that wasn't a real job,

00:03:01.146 --> 00:03:03.808
so architecture seemed to fall
somewhere in the middle.

00:03:03.832 --> 00:03:06.933
AG: He ended up starting
a consulting business to help architects,

00:03:06.957 --> 00:03:10.668
engineers, contractors and building owners
improve their work spaces.

00:03:10.692 --> 00:03:13.022
Soon WeWork was a client.

00:03:13.046 --> 00:03:16.147
In 2015, WeWork acquired Dave's company.

00:03:16.171 --> 00:03:18.196
He became WeWork's chief product officer,

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.091
and then chief growth officer.

00:03:20.115 --> 00:03:22.097
He oversaw all of real estate, design,

00:03:22.121 --> 00:03:24.743
construction, sales and marketing.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.168
In the spring of 2019 he left.

00:03:28.192 --> 00:03:31.101
Six months later,
after WeWork filed for an IPO,